  aciklama:
  - "Bir \u015Feyi a\u015F\u0131r\u0131 istemenin iyi olmad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131,
    bu yap\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131nda \"olaca\u011F\u0131 varsa da olmad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131\"
    \xE7ok \xF6nce \xF6\u011Frenmi\u015Fsin {{isim}} sen. Beklentilerimizdeki \"karar\"
    ve evrene yayd\u0131\u011F\u0131m\u0131z bu dengeli enerji, dile\u011Fimizin
    ger\xE7ekle\u015Fmesini sa\u011Flayacak bir iksirdeki \"en uygun doz\" gibi.
    Ne bir dirhem az\u0131, ne biraz fazlas\u0131. En \xF6nemlisi k\u0131vam\u0131.
    Ba\u015Flarda onu \xE7ok istemi\u015Fsin. Ayr\u0131l\u0131k a\u015Famas\u0131nda
    ise g\xF6zden \xE7ok h\u0131zl\u0131 \xE7\u0131karm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n. \u015Eu
    s\u0131ralar, ikisinin aras\u0131nda bir \"denge\" halini ald\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    g\xF6r\xFCyorum. Fal\u0131n\u0131n son k\u0131s\u0131mlar\u0131, aran\u0131zdaki
    yolun a\xE7\u0131lmaya ba\u015Flad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 ifade ediyor..."
